<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK APR DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 5.78 BLN.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK APR DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 5.78 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on</p>
<p>Thursday the required daily money market liquidity balance for</p>
<p>the rest of the month was 5.78 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for April 28		    9,000</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for April	    6,334</p>
<p> Average reserves to April 23			 6,505</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    5.783</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@Reuters.fi</p>
</text>
